# The facade over the kernel model (raw_facade_harness.h). raw_facade_arguments_test: its MTLArgumentEncoder over
# descriptors and over a function's runs, nested encoders and refusals, and the gpuResourceID of its textures and samplers,
# named at the first ask and forgotten when they go. raw_facade_heap_use_test: useHeap on its render and compute encoders
# is one use of the heap in the plan and of its arena in each job at 4 and 404 textures, host-written for a shared heap;
# a heap texture either encoder uses alone names its own range. Each test's unit holds the kernel model's IOKit calls.
[objc_library(
    name = name + "_unit",
    testonly = True,
    srcs = RAW_HOST_HEADERS + [
        name + ".mm",
        "empty_pack.h",
        "made_metallib.h",
